[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3899415969","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116260#issuecomment-3899415969","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116260","id":3899415969,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7obF2h","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T20:56:38Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T20:56:38Z","body":"I'd say this is expected, changing files the editor is actively using is not supported in general, I don't think that can be expected in any software","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3899415969/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3899611739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116260#issuecomment-3899611739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116260","id":3899611739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ob1pb","user":{"login":"DawidMoza","id":25403239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDAzMjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25403239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza","html_url":"https://github.com/DawidMoza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T21:33:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T21:33:58Z","body":"> I'd say this is expected, changing files the editor is actively using is not supported in general, I don't think that can be expected in any software\n\nBut isn't project.godot file tracked? If I edit it in an external editor then there is a pop-up window that allows me to reload. External file changes are tracked in most text editors like Notepad++, IntelliJ etc..., so I would say that this is rather standard behavior.\n\n<img width=\"544\" height=\"333\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/977fa238-16a1-49ff-9ad0-9db8be557545\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3899611739/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5422726365","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116260#issuecomment-5422726365","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116260","id":5422726365,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQzg83Q","user":{"login":"stdc105","id":58755983,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzU1OTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58755983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105","html_url":"https://github.com/stdc105","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdc105/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T08:35:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T08:36:33Z","body":"I'd like to give this issue a bump. The problem really is when there's a change on the filesystem, the editor doesn't pick it up and notify us to reload the project, especially so when there is already a mechanism to detect externally changed `project.godot` file. And this applies to more than \"edited by external editors\" cases too, it also applies to syncing code over git, and this can cause silent reverts if one doesn't read all the diffs all the time. Our team recently had a silently reverted export config and was a little confused until we went through git history and recover the changes.\n\nAlso the issue is still in the latest stable Godot version 4.7.2.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5422726365/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5427693928","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116260#issuecomment-5427693928","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116260","id":5427693928,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQ4QJaA","user":{"login":"DawidMoza","id":25403239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDAzMjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25403239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza","html_url":"https://github.com/DawidMoza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DawidMoza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T15:52:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T15:52:46Z","body":"> I'd say this is expected, changing files the editor is actively using is not supported in general, I don't think that can be expected in any software\n\n@AThousandShips I reviewed my original report after the bump from @stdc105 \n\nI want to clarify that the problem not only occurs when export window is open, so it's not only about file being actively in use. If Godot is open (export window closed) and export_presets.cfg is modified, then the modified data isn't visible in the export window.\n\nGodot reset is needed for those changes to be visible.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5427693928/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]